{"step_index":235,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T00:25:52Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-30T09:25:52+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-30T09:25:55+09:00\nThe search for \"\"출판사인쇄사 검색시스템\" \"작은통일\"\" returned the following summary:\n'출판사인쇄사 검색시스템'에서 '작은통일'이라는 상호를 검색하신 결과에 대한 정보입니다.\n\n문화체육관광부에서 운영하는 **[출판사/인쇄사 검색시스템](https://book.mcst.go.kr)**을 통해 확인한 결과, '작은통일'이라는 명칭의 출판사가 등록되어 있는 것으로 나타납니다[1][2].\n\n*   **상호명:** 작은통일[1][2]\n*   **업종:** 출판사[1][2]\n*   **소재지:** 부산광역시 강서구[1][2]\n*   **영업현황:** 영업 중[1][2]\n\n해당 검색시스템은 전국에 등록된 출판사와 인쇄사의 현황을 조회할 수 있는 공식 서비스입니다. 더 자세한 정보나 등록 관련 문의는 해당 지자체(부산광역시 강서구) 문화예술과로 연락하시기 바랍니다[1][3].\n\nSources:\n[1] [mcst.go.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEAeRW2YeqvQMuAvLw5yzdGz2cVg4zjOaHHqIHyf9kSkS5ogcpwJEjjTphgmyfaq4uKyafjEg78i6oF-p-UtgRQjvT4fqdMV3N5mCMIyB7eMq4NyhHF4L0ixC2ZVeBqf-piMDbUMRFQbM1d572tNoGEgfArn7vCYONFE86QG1QkZTHlBTV_klmdSgX25iN57-MeakNWO5M-3ycijkRuDT8VDBdsL3E_Zh0KqzRrqXO8-LXx_4FQ5wvePFMHL_craYyhvsZONL0OOHVbHCBccEU03loKedH9O4VykPdFAGE6-HuW3x-e8Q==)\n[2] [mcst.go.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG-wtx8skEn-ERv09iEeCH1YNxT5DbBYi1Yz0hH7raYXLgpX6-nTQHhfx9ie7F68jdeKuvhe9A7Wr06vZYZlGfQY8PBaboJG-I6gpc0voWatkgQ9qhkPkQAdt6SzqFkmnS90AKDdCZ8l6kzc4_1HjcC0YjRT8nBJjTmKBrQ_4bRpZ3__uff_FSHyTVdehWgtSzGaX1YkR_89PyDaCiIpT9jl7AtanaWO7iDYgO6E4qIHb88mLNz7OUrdtSuImEPOXotuFDMqQpz0uZX7bYXGlR_4RHTYOa-L01YRviD3MbsibGe2s6gOBM_BWE=)\n[3] [mcst.go.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGy7TYoghQ7UCHHAwGPb1DHuZHnXP2mnHlECSdp8igerMv3NFIo-3MAChGzK1nN2i9VLXcAJM0LTIF3GR7nsMlhXRWfWt_MxLGfE6HYM57e34ynMfxXe53Y6fHZKZUwV3wY-0hJNgdhdvqHyMP_xarEYUBEjnxJHpDBGa9dBCuYJDkSMrMjKhuymQiVbsQGPRwzb1u86_A0NAiny2VzaV8XkDG5vPlRdkx2MfXy5dNwpVV9tcwm4wudprZ6XdhOXFv06lrueyzaIFTp3aF3yELpGUSr_HzNXgq3KYic3UM1THOU4BUY6fQtKm1Nzw==)"}
{"step_index":236,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T00:25:55Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const https = require('https');\nconst http = require('http');\n\nfunction queryMCST() {\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    // book.mcst.go.kr search\n    const postData = 'name=' + encodeURIComponent('작은통일');\n    const req = http.request('http://book.mcst.go.kr/html/sub01.php', {\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers: {\n        'Content-Type': 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded',\n        'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0'\n      }\n    }, (res) => {\n      let data = '';\n      res.on('data', chunk => data += chunk);\n      res.on('end', () => resolve(data));\n      res.on('error', err => reject(err));\n    });\n    req.on('error', err => reject(err));\n    req.write(postData);\n    req.end();\n  });\n}\n\nqueryMCST().then(data => {\n  console.log('Result len:', data.length);\n  // print text\n  const clean = data.replace(/<script[\\s\\S]*?<\\/script>/gi, '').replace(/<style[\\s\\S]*?<\\/style>/gi, '').replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ');\n  console.log(clean.substring(0, 1500));\n}).catch(e => {\n  console.error(e.message);\n});\n","Description":"Query MCST for 작은통일","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\8d910c96-69ac-4dcb-b68c-aa4d0f2ced8e\\scratch\\query_mcst.js","toolAction":"Writing query_mcst.js","toolSummary":"Create query_mcst script"}}]}
